<p><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;">Donate Online</span></strong></span></p>
<p>It’s Secure, quick, and easy. Your funds are used in your community where the needs are the greatest. You can also become a Monthly Sustainer or give an Honor/Memorial gift.</p>
<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start"><a href="https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/230787/#!/donation/checkout" class="btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2">Donate Online</a></p>
<p><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;">Donate by Mail</span></strong></span></p>
<p>To donate by mail, please send a check directly to The Salvation Army Marietta Corps.</p>
<p><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px;">Donate By Phone</span></strong></span></p>
<p>To donate by phone, please call:</p>
<p>1-800-SAL-ARMY<br>(<a href="tel:+18007252769">1-800-725-2769</a>)</p>
<p>Credit card donations are accepted.</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong>Make a Major Gift</strong></span></span></p>
<p>Learn more about Major Gifts, how to make a large donation, an outright gift, gifts of stock, cash, real estate, gifts-in-kind, or corporate gifts-in-kind.</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong>Make a Planned Gift</strong></span></span></p>
<p><a href="/usa-southern-territory/planned-giving-wills-gift-annuities-and-trusts/" target="">Learn more about Planned Giving</a>, how to make an estate or Will gift, and/or give through gift annuities &amp; trusts.</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 16px;"><span style="color: #ed1c2b;"><strong>Give to Project Share</strong></span></span></p>
<p><a href="https://projectshareinfo.com/" target="">Learn more about Project Share</a>, a program that provides Financial Emergency Assistance to individuals and families facing a temporary crisis that threatens their home. Project SHARE attempts to target the most urgent need, whether it is a utility bill, a part of a rent payment, or an emergency prescription. Donate through your Georgia Power or Gas South bill today.</p>
